# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# FDUA: NEVER commit raw challenge data or any per-segment derived table that
# could reconstruct raw probe values (posted limit, P85, distributions, counts).
*.geojson
*.gpkg
*.xlsx
*.pdf
*.zip
# per-segment derived tables (carry raw limit/P85/coords) — keep local only
blindtest_key.json
blindtest_results.json
roadaudit_key.json
roadaudit_results.json
cv_labels*.json
cv_validation*.json
cv_manifest*.json
# (aggregate-only summaries are allowed: cv_audit_summary.json, scoring_cv_summary.json,
#  validation_maharashtra.csv = district-level aggregates)
meta.json
cv_validation_sonnet.json
streetview_shortlist.md

# --- Exception: published legal instruments -------------------------------
# Government gazettes, statutes, ministerial regulations and police
# notifications, published by the states concerned and freely available from
# their official portals. These are NOT challenge data and carry no FDUA
# restriction; the blanket *.pdf rule above would otherwise exclude them.
# Scope is limited to sources/legal/ — nothing else is un-ignored.
!sources/legal/**/*.pdf
!sources/legal/**/*.md
